WHAT IS CHAT MEMORY?
--------------------
Chat Memory allows the AI assistant to remember previous conversations.

Without Memory:
User: Show customer details
AI: Customer Ravi has CIBIL score 760.

User: Is he eligible?
AI: I do not know who he is.

With Memory:
User: Show customer details
AI: Customer Ravi has CIBIL score 760.

User: Is he eligible?
AI: Yes, Ravi is eligible.

WHY DO WE NEED MEMORY?
----------------------
1. Understand follow-up questions.
2. Maintain conversation context.
3. Improve user experience.
4. Make AI feel conversational.
5. Avoid repeating information.

